  "created": "2026-02-12T22:02:32.56Z",
  "description": "GDShrapt.CLI is a .NET global tool for semantic analysis and safe refactoring of GDScript 2.0 (Godot 4.x) projects.\n\nKey Features:\n- Safe project-wide rename with confidence levels (Strict, Potential, NameMatch)\n- Semantic validation with type inference (GD1xxx-GD8xxx diagnostics)\n- Style linting with naming conventions and presets (GDLxxx rules)\n- Auto-formatting with style extraction\n- Dead code detection, dependency analysis, metrics, type coverage\n- CI-friendly exit codes and JSON/SARIF output\n\nInstall: dotnet tool install -g GDShrapt.CLI\nUsage: gdshrapt rename old_name new_name --diff",
  "id": "GDShrapt.CLI",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-02-12T22:05:40.577Z",
